> Interpretation and limits

Complete streams are capped at one million bits; admission avoids huge unbounded
unary allocation. Negative output counts, truncated words and trailing bits are
errors. Empty streams decode only zero requested words. The plotted geometric
expectation is an exact distributional calculation rather than timing data.

The complete editable C++ programs save figures locally; results contain
ordinary computed Markdown. Selected counters describe actual producer
operations, excluding validation when stated.

> References

The recurrence and proof above derive the implemented behavior.

